<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Spindle third-party licences</title>
<style>
  body { font: 14px/1.5 system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 960px; margin: 2em auto; padding: 0 1em; color: #222; }
  h1 { font-size: 1.5em; } h2 { font-size: 1.15em; margin-top: 2em; border-top: 1px solid #ddd; padding-top: 1em; }
  pre { white-space: pre-wrap; background: #f6f6f6; padding: 1em; font-size: 12px; }
  ul.crates { columns: 2; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Third-party licences</h1>
<p>Spindle is licensed under the Apache License 2.0. The binaries include the Rust crates below,
used under the licences shown. The Inter typeface (SIL OFL 1.1) and the Lucide icons (ISC) are listed in NOTICE.</p>
<h2>Overview</h2>
<ul>
{{#each overview}}
  <li><a href="#{{id}}">{{name}}</a> ({{count}})</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
{{#each licenses}}
<h2 id="{{id}}">{{name}}</h2>
<p>Used by:</p>
<ul class="crates">
{{#each used_by}}
  <li><a href="{{#if crate.repository}}{{crate.repository}}{{else}}https://crates.io/crates/{{crate.name}}{{/if}}">{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</a></li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
<pre>{{text}}</pre>
{{/each}}
</body>
</html>
